"P2316147742" "Freakshow have been rampaging from business office to business office non-stop today! They're terrorizing everyone inside. Here's the strange part: the Freaks are organized into half a dozen different raiding parties. When the Freaks show this much organization, I get worried. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you help stop the office rampages?</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P1259103925" "Stop the office rampages"
// SendOffString :
"P351780346" "See if you can find some clue to what the Freakshow are up to. It might help us stop them."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3750284110" "Bust Freak leader and his crew"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3788209308" "You've got to stop this office rampage."

