"P1211110109" "I just got word that several city councilmen have been kidnapped by the Freakshow. And get this: the original kidnappers were just attacked by another group of Freaks! This is so chaotic, it could only be another Freaklympics event. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can I count on you to rescue the city councilmen from the Freakshow?</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P2553162502" "Rescue the city councilman from the Freakshow"
// SendOffString :
"P399515768" "Those Freaks may be fighting each other, but I suspect they'll drop everything to attack you."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4098827930" "Save councilmen from Freakshow"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P526598057" "The Freaklympics have gone full contact. You need to get those kidnapped city councilmen to safety, fast."

