// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1146884131" "I've heard from the police; they have all those city councilmen in protective custody. The police tell me that the various Freakshow factions are looking at the Freaklympics as their big chance to win Dreck's favor. So they're going all out to win, no matter who gets hurt in the process. I have a feeling that this is far from over."
// RandomFameString :
"P4172556754" "{HeroName} saved a bunch of city councilmen from the Freakshow!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2020807081" "We've had a lucky break in the Freaklympics. Seems like one of the Freaks you brought in cracked under police questioning and told us about the next event. You won't believe this, but it's a scavenger hunt for Council gear. It's supposed to take place in Council bases! But it gets better. The Freak responsible for scheduling events, a juicer called the Kerner, is going to be on one of these raids. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you can catch the Kerner, it may give us a shot at stopping the next events before they start.</a> Can you do it?"
// AcceptString :
"P902030728" "Catch the Kerner"
// SendOffString :
"P3861953" "Between the Freakshow and the Council, this could get nasty. Just remember that you're after the Kerner first and foremost."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2531672009" "Bust the Kerner and his crew"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1001874269" "Remember that your top priority is to find the Kerner."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1033138470" "The sounds of heavy fighting inside indicate that this Freaklympics event is far from over."

