// Dialog :
"P2029227704" "You found and defeated the Kerner, and found a list of upcoming events."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1970944873" "That list of Freaklympic events is just what we need. Now we can start anticipating their attacks instead of just reacting to them. I'll get copies of this list to the police and my other contacts."
// RandomFameString :
"P2560996051" "{HeroName} took on the Council and the Freaks! All at one time!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3500559583" "Thanks to that Freaklympics schedule you got, we should be able to stop the Freaks before they can do much more damage.  Apparently, the next scheduled event involves breaking into research labs and stealing high tech equipment. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you help us prevent those Freakshow tech thefts?</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P2125776940" "Prevent the Freakshow tech thefts"
// SendOffString :
"P2271434837" "If we're lucky, you'll be able to stop this raid before it really starts."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P160819822" "Defeat all Freaks in lab"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3930188179" "I want that Freakshow theft stopped, {HeroName}. We have to put an end to these crazy Freaklympics!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3484227447" "Smashed glass and twisted aluminum testify to the presence of the Freakshow."

