// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostages 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2155253678" "Lab technician"
// Description :
"P1892720870" "technicians to rescue"
// SingularDescription :
"P1853472207" "Save the last technician!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2045859512" "I was so scared, until you arrived!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3169702120" "You stopped the Freaks' lab theft. But something one of the Freaks said sticks in you mind."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1223761125" "It sounds like all of the Freaks at that lab were members of the Upstart Faction, a group of Freakshow dedicated to total anarchy and the end of all government. Their leader, a young Freak named Upstart, was like a living messiah to them. But he was captured several months ago. If they are planning on breaking him out of the Brick House, that could take these Freaklympics from bad to madness. I'll see if I can turn anything up."
// RandomFameString :
"P3520621386" "The Freakshow trashed my mom's lab yesterday. Luckily, {HeroName} showed up to save the day!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3742693881" "We have another Freaklympic event about to go down, and this one is big. Apparently, Dreck's set a number of targets for arson, including a warehouse holding all of the new computers for Paragon City's elementary schools. That's low, even for them. With all the money budgeted for post-war reconstruction, I doubt the city can afford more computers for those kids. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you save the warehouse before the Freakshow torch it?</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P3147918150" "Save the warehouse before the Freakshow torch it"
// SendOffString :
"P2672400318" "Also, I've been looking into the plans of the Freakshow's Upstart Faction. I haven't learned anything concrete yet, but I'll keep digging."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2138902438" "Stop Freaks torching warehouse"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1520515695" "You've got to find all of their incendiary devices."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3746234313" "You're surprised even the Freakshow could sink low enough to destroy school computers, especially in tough times like these."

