// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P857697788" "I've been looking into the activities of that Freakshow faction commanded by Upstart, and I think I know what they're planning. They found a section of sewers that pass directly under the Brick House, the big prison in Brickstown, and they're planning to pack it full of explosives. If they set off that charge, it'll collapse about half of the Brick House and take out a major chunk of Brickstown itself. And then they figure they can grab Upstart in the middle of the chaos. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to stop that bombing, {HeroName}.</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P1501821830" "Stop the bombing"
// SendOffString :
"P2797994498" "You can access the sewers through an entrance in Skyway City. That way you can surprise the Freaks."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3283840013" "If the Freaks set off those bombs, a lot of people are going to suffer."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2474462415" "The somber gloom of these caverns is at odds with the Freaks' raucous laughter."

