// Dialog :
"P1448967227" "You prevented this Freakshow faction from freeing their imprisoned leader, Upstart. Something you overheard during the fight sticks in your mind."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P607878974" "Strange. It seems the leader of the Freakshow doesn't want Upstart freed. I'd like to know more about this, but first we have to shut the Freaklympics down once and for all."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3593357694" "According to that event schedule you found, the Freaklympics are nearly over. All that's left on the schedule is their award ceremony. One of Dreck's own top men, a Tank Freak called Mistah Static, will be giving out the medals. If we could arrest him, it could help solve dozens of different investigations. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you crash the Freaklympics awards ceremony and arrest Mistah Static?</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P2108083647" "Crash the Freaklympics awards ceremony and arrest Mistah Static"
// SendOffString :
"P3282641800" "Let's blow out the torch on this one. I know you can do it."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3797835094" "Bust Mistah Static, his crew"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1519609902" "Mistah Static will probably be well protected. You should be prepared for a fight."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1623562649" "This is where the Freaklympics end."

